  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 19th level, whenever a mageknight successfully confirms a critical hit, she can use a sphere ability as an immediate action. The sphere ability must include the target of the attack as one of its targets or in its area of effect. Using this sphere ability does not provoke an attack of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mageknight#toc76\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
